co/storage/v1/object/public/business-images/90-1785359513191-izcli0vne9.webp","https://zultqdhzynoftvaglant.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/business-images/90-1785359513467-8icjrgjuf6.webp"],"tiktok_url":null,"video_urls":[],"break_start":null,"closed_days":null,"description":"At Buns, you’re in charge of your burger. Choose one of our three burgers—Angus chuck beef,  Ground turkey, and homemade veggie—and start building! We offer a wide selection of both traditional and unique cheeses and toppings so you can create a simple, classic burger or one with a gourmet flare. If you’re hankering for a sandwich, we’ve got grilled salmon and grilled chicken for you, as well as footlong hot dogs. And if you want to skip the bun altogether, you can top off your Caesar salad with any of the burger patty or sandwich options. Of course, no meal would be complete without a pile of handcut fries on the side and one of our delicious hand-spun milkshakes.\n\nBuns is Chapel Hill’s very own, locally owned and operated burger joint. Our patties are handcrafted daily, and our fries are cut fresh throughout the day using only the finest Idaho potatoes. Our white, wheat and brioche buns are delivered to us freshly baked every day.\n\nCome dine in or carry out at our Columbia Street location in downtown Chapel Hill. Buns is also available for catering events, with a range of options to fit your needs.\n","image_url_2":null,"image_url_3":null,"menu_item_1":null,"menu_item_2":null,"menu_item_3":null,"owner_phone":null,"website_url":"https://bunsofchapelhill.com/","facebook_url":null,"menu_price_1":null,"menu_price_2":null,"menu_price_3":null,"review_count":1020,"template_key":null,"website_live":false,"website_slug":null,"display_order":999,"instagram_url":"","thumbnail_url":"https://zultqdhzynoftvaglant.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/business-thumbnails/business-90/thumbnail.webp?v=1793042420352","rating_updated":"2026-10-31T20:33:19.679+00:00","website_status":"published","google