l notes and cranberry-like tartness.\r\n\r\n*PRECAUTION*: Hibiscus flowers may be intercropped in fields that also grow peanuts. Caution for individuals with severe peanut allergies\r\n\r\nCaffeine: None\r\n\r\nMade to order! Tea is steeped for 3 to 5 minutes","is_available":true,"pickup_price":null,"display_order":72,"delivery_price":null,"thumbnail_path":"110/thumbnails/1792944256093-3eb606c0-8dab-4302-bdbb-bc38f4a63611-Blueberry-Rooibos.webp","show_on_website":true,"source_platform":"doordash"},{"id":2525,"name":"Chamomile Medley","price":4.75,"created_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:18.128494+00:00","image_path":"110/display/1792944257700-1d547349-6ea2-40c7-9bea-fc716efae637-Chamomile-Medley.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:18.128494+00:00","business_id":110,"category_id":2554,"description":"A calming ensemble of chamomile with hints of refreshing citrus and mint.\r\n\r\nOur signature chamomile blend highlights golden Croatian chamomile \r\nblossoms that are masterfully paired with soothing herbal counterpoints of lemon verbena, lemongrass and spearmint. Striking the perfect balance of savory and floral, Chamomile Medley is a delightful way to relax and refresh the palate at the end of a meal.\r\n\r\nMade to order! Tea is steeped between 3-5 minutes","is_available":true,"pickup_price":null,"display_order":73,"delivery_price":null,"thumbnail_path":"110/thumbnails/1792944257536-19a56992-ece5-4fab-842b-05851e6db26e-Chamomile-Medley.webp","show_on_website":true,"source_platform":"doordash"},{"id":2526,"name":"Earl Grey","price":4.75,"created_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:20.18639+00:00","image_path":"110/display/1792944259941-fc8123b8-b9db-47cd-aa7b-05713adee16c-Earl-Grey.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:20.18639+00:00","business_id":110,"category_id":2554,"description":"Rich, smooth black tea with the lofty floral and citrusy high notes of Italian bergamot.\r\n\r\nA special reserve for Earl Grey lovers, we infuse our top grades of Yunnan Dianhong black tea with the essential oil pressed from real bergamot citrus fruits grown in Calabria, Italy to yield our Earl Grey Supreme blend. We select only bergamot oil made during the first pressing of the year, around November-December, which has the most fragrant perfume and floral aromatic complexity.\r\n\r\nCaffeine: Medium\r\n\r\nMade to order! Tea is steeped between 3-5 minutes","is_available":true,"pickup_price":null,"display_order":74,"delivery_price":null,"thumbnail_path":"110/thumbnails/1792944259783-e6ab4e24-f2f1-4f77-966b-6798b63e72bb-Earl-Grey.webp","show_on_website":true,"source_platform":"doordash"},{"id":2527,"name":"English Breakfast","price":4.75,"created_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:21.73321+00:00","image_path":"110/display/1792944261317-0603a5bf-1ae2-40a9-99de-b91db88bb8a0-English-Breakfast.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:21.73321+00:00","business_id":110,"category_id":2554,"description":"Lively, robust red cup with a brisk flavor and notes of dates and raisins.\r\n\r\nOur English Breakfast has a rich red infusion color that is malty and robust with sweet, chocolatey undertones and a brisk body that can stand up to milk and sugar.\r\n\r\nCaffeine: High\r\n\r\nMade to order! Tea is steeped between 3-5 minutes","is_available":true,"pickup_price":null,"display_order":75,"delivery_price":null,"thumbnail_path":"110/thumbnails/1792944261122-025d698f-10b7-4026-aeaf-56348ad9b996-English-Breakfast.webp","show_on_website":true,"source_platform":"doordash"},{"id":2528,"name":"Green Tea Mint","price":4.75,"created_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:23.068763+00:00","image_path":"110/display/1792944262864-574c0aeb-d9be-40b6-ae15-536d18c7636b-Green-Tea-Mint.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:23.068763+00:00","business_id":110,"category_id":2554,"description":"Mellow with a sweet mint flavor, a pleasant toasty note and hints of chocolate.\r\n\r\nThe fresh, sweet flavor and long-lasting candy cane mint aroma of peppermint from the Pacific Northwest blends smoothly with the pleasant character of roasted green tea. This blend evokes mint chocolate in a clean, gratifying way. Green Tea Mint makes a wonderful cup to enjoy after a meal.\r\n\r\nCaffeine: Low\r\n\r\nMade to order! Tea is steeped between 3-5 minutes","is_available":true,"pickup_price":null,"display_order":76,"delivery_price":null,"thumbnail_path":"110/thumbnails/1792944262694-3a0d2068-163f-4d52-a2b5-572130dff97a-Green-Tea-Mint.webp","show_on_website":true,"source_platform":"doordash"},{"id":2529,"name":"Jasmine Green Tea","price":4.75,"created_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:24.873921+00:00","image_path":"110/display/1792944264122-613750ab-27f9-4420-89fa-3f215e6449c6-Jasmine-Green-Tea.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:24.873921+00:00","business_id":110,"category_id":2554,"description":"Fresh and soothing green tea scented with the enchanting aroma of jasmine blossoms.\r\n\r\nJasmine tea is the most popular flower-scented tea in East Asia. Its enchanting, unforgettable aroma is created through an artisanal method of tea scenting that dates back more than 800 years.\r\n\r\nCaffeine: Medium\r\n\r\nMade to order! Tea is steeped between 3-5 minutes","is_available":true,"pickup_price":null,"display_order":77,"delivery_price":null,"thumbnail_path":"110/thumbnails/1792944263956-022422fa-4131-4034-98f5-9d0d1d5e3c08-Jasmine-Green-Tea.webp","show_on_website":true,"source_platform":"doordash"},{"id":2530,"name":"Tangerine Ginger","price":4.75,"created_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:26.226017+00:00","image_path":"110/display/1792944265996-a8689c81-dd04-4657-9300-0025f32ac686-Tangerine-Ginger.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:26.226017+00:00","business_id":110,"category_id":2554,"description":"Combining a punchy hibiscus blend with zesty, revitalizing ginger and succulent citrus. Organic hibiscus flowers, ginger root, rosehips, licorice root, orange peel, schisandra berries and essential tangerine and orange oils.\r\n*PRECAUTION*: May contain peanuts. Caution for individuals with severe peanut allergies\r\n(milk not available as an option with this tea.)\r\n\r\nCaffeine Level: None\r\n\r\nMade to order! Tea is steeped between 3-5 minutes","is_available":true,"pickup_price":null,"display_order":78,"delivery_price":null,"thumbnail_path":"110/thumbnails/1792944265835-0f205077-7cfa-4de2-ab9a-1fec3af5bd90-Tangerine-Ginger.webp","show_on_website":true,"source_platform":"doordash"},{"id":2531,"name":"Turmeric Mango","price":4.75,"created_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:27.530052+00:00","image_path":"110/display/1792944267321-d7ec940a-8925-47ea-a5b6-1f9bb3fe1824-Turmeric-Mango.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:27.530052+00:00","business_id":110,"category_id":2554,"description":"A tropical take on turmeric featuring luscious and juicy Sri Lanka mango, tangy sweet pineapple, fragrant yuzu citrus peel and exotic top notes of jasmine and makrut lime.\r\n\r\nCaffeine: Low\r\n\r\nMade to order! Tea is steeped between 3-5 minutes","is_available":true,"pickup_price":null,"display_order":79,"delivery_price":null,"thumbnail_path":"110/thumbnails/1792944267150-06cbfc8b-63e5-4631-abdc-8b0b0ffb8014-Turmeric-Mango.webp","show_on_website":true,"source_platform":"doordash"},{"id":2532,"name":"Peach Blossom White Tea","price":5,"created_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:28.913944+00:00","image_path":"110/display/1792944268712-20a65a38-31dd-423b-9aa7-c6e8c8c3fa2e-Peach-Blossom-White-Tea.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-25T16:04:28.913944+00:00","business_id":110,"category_id":2554,"description":"This luscious blend enhances the natural peach undertones of White Peony, with the essence of real peaches. Embellished with hints of zesty tangerine essential oil, this blend is a fun and fruity introduction to white tea.\r\n\r\nCaffeine Level: Low\r\n\r\nMade to order! Tea is steeped between 3-5 minutes","is_available":true,"pickup_price":null,"display_order":80,"delivery_price":null,"thumbnail_path":"110/thumbnails/1792944268563-2fa88b57-8942-497e-bf06-32f635b06e7f-Peach-Blossom-White-Tea.webp","show_on_website":true,"source_platform":"doordash"},{"