d sushi dishes with us.\n\n🍽️ Open for lunch today until 2:00 PM.\n📍Champa Thai & Sushi – Brier Creek.  #champathaiandsushi #briercreekeats #raleigheats #thaifood #briercreek\". ","posted_at":"2026-07-31T20:51:02.902+00:00","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:51:03.887479+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-07-31T20:51:03.664+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:51:03.664+00:00","business_id":6,"error_message":null,"stored_image_url":"https://zultqdhzynoftvaglant.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/business-instagram/champathaiandsushi/Dbdjhz4gpf--762864487_18056481623786699_4384720405328702026_n.jpg","instagram_post_id":"Dbdjhz4gpf-","instagram_post_url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dbdjhz4gpf-/","instagram_username":"champathaiandsushi","original_image_url":"https://scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/762864487_18056481623786699_4384720405328702026_n.jpg?stp=cmp1_dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=vhki_ar_Rw8Q7kNvwGHerew&_nc_oc=AdpoFN50SU1-j4guYkCz2uTEglm5aJZ0a-QBspPP1xKcH35yeErQaRO-1o6QzYww3_8&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=3RjixsBbvuCkNguqLSsr_w&_nc_ss=7b6a8&oh=00_AQH7xmkDjPXc7AhFmtQD14JkcavgGFzL1peav16AubAKaQ&oe=6A72C2CD"},{"id":"23855d25-ab95-4b9a-af7f-ce8b1536b7e3","status":"active","caption":"622 likes, 67 comments - magnifgoeshard on July 11, 2026: \"SPOTS THAT DESERVE A LONG LINE\n\n🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨🚨\n\nI’M SORRY I WAS GATEKEEPING THIS ONE!!! @bbasak_han has some of the crispest, flavorful fried chicken in the area!!! Whether you go plain Jane or razzle dazzle with the flavors, YOU WILL NOT BE DISAPPOINTED. I’m shocked that this spot isn’t busier than what it is because it’s definitely worth a long line. Yall don’t sleep, move your feet AND GET YOU SOME! 😎🔥🔥🔥 #food #friedchicken #raleigh\". ","posted_at":"2026-07-31T20:55:25.03+00:00","created_at":"2026-07-23T00:41:32.885423+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-07-31T20:55:26.082+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07