0:52:41.86+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:52:42.077353+00:00","business_id":17,"error_message":null,"stored_image_url":"https://zultqdhzynoftvaglant.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/business-instagram/koreankitchennc/CX1apuwu64m-641673558_18561139849005124_8726158783393970341_n.jpg","instagram_post_id":"CX1apuwu64m","instagram_post_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/CX1apuwu64m/","instagram_username":"koreankitchennc","original_image_url":"https://scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/641673558_18561139849005124_8726158783393970341_n.jpg?stp=c288.0.864.864a_dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=QTGAEUKaAh8Q7kNvwFzMjq1&_nc_oc=Adp7IstcJOnNsYtvHDTv-ZM-wDYvCiNCycFhNbTuzOL8g6xhkeghgb036p79BjV4Qjk&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=dHOoXguPFOCyd93UWaFYdA&_nc_ss=7b6a8&oh=00_AQGliRU77VF26ddRjRdNb3XTKmMsuN_29_Xxnvcf0POaDA&oe=6A72C4B5"},{"id":"dc3c49c9-60b7-4986-9475-30953e599d10","status":"active","caption":"4,016 likes, 139 comments - raleating on February 4, 2026: \"🇰🇷 Have you been to this authentic family style Korean restaurant that has been a Raleigh staple for almost 20 years? @seoulgardennc has been a family owned favorite in Raleigh for decades known for their delicious famous style Korean dishes! (hosted) \n\n🍜 We started with their Seafood Pancake, Soon Du Bu Tofu Soup, Korean Fried Wings (a must) and all of the awesome bonchon that’s all made in house! We loved their L.A. Galbi, Beef Bulgogi, Chulpan Bokkeum Noodles, and Yum So Tang Soup! \n\n🍖 And they have the option to do Korean BBQ at some tables too (call ahead to secure a table)! This is my go to spot for Korean food cravings so check them out in Raleigh and tell them we sent you! \n\n📍Seoul Garden\n4701 Atlantic Avenue, Raleigh, NC\n*not affiliated with location in Cary\n\n🔥Save this reel as a reminder and share it with a friend you want to go with! Follow @raleating for more Triangle food and drink posts!\n\n#raleighnc  #nc #ncfoodfinds #raleigh #korean\". ","posted_at":"2026-07-31T20:53:05.763+00:00","created_at":"2026-07-23T00:40:06.982569+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-07-31T20:53:06.332+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:53:06.533159+00:00","business_id":21,"error_message":null,"stored_image_url":"https://zultqdhzynoftvaglant.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/business-instagram/seoulgardennc/DUWmuF1EfUa-626206757_787482510356993_3398774454109253437_n.jpg","instagram_post_id":"DUWmuF1EfUa","instagram_post_url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DUWmuF1EfUa/","instagram_username":"seoulgardennc","original_image_url":"https://scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/626206757_787482510356993_3398774454109253437_n.jpg?stp=cmp1_dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=kz6PQR9HQPsQ7kNvwGOEXA8&_nc_oc=AdqNn7vi0oL9ZKhPxY_5OHT1tVs056Pl6MnPlnvsqw8PCvzsJ3aHRhnFi-NxmcZmE2U&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=TUgIRNq1qcar5n50tyZKWQ&_nc_ss=7b6a8&oh=00_AQGGuqlZKoay_HH6y0EZz-ZwMNfnQDJDshMaqXShBbJjBA&oe=6A72C1A9"}]'::jsonb)
