iable Information (PII): We may collect PII, such as your name, email address, phone number, and address, when you voluntarily provide it to us through forms on our website, such as when you make a reservation, sign up for our newsletter, or contact us.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Non-Personally Identifiable Information (Non-PII): We may automatically collect Non-PII, such as your IP address, browser type, device information, and usage data, through cookies and similar technologies.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">3. How We Use Your Information&nbsp;</p><ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; list-style: disc; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-inline: 0.5em 0px;\"><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">To Provide Services: We use your PII to fulfill your requests, such as processing reservations, responding to inquiries, and providing you with the services you have requested.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">For Marketing Purposes: We may use your email address to send you promotional materials, newsletters, and special offers, but you can opt-out of these communications at any time.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">To Improve Our Website: We use Non-PII to analyze website traffic, identify areas for improvement, and personalize your experience.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">For Legal Compliance: We may use your information to comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">4. Sharing Your Information&nbsp;</p><ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; list-style: disc; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-inline: 0.5em 0px;\"><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Third-Party Service Providers: We may share your PII with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our website, conducting our business, or servicing you, but only to the extent necessary and subject to confidentiality agreements.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Legal Requirements: We may disclose your information if required by law, court order, or to protect our rights, property, or safety, or the rights, property, or safety of others.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Business Transfers: In the event of a business transfer, such as a merger or sale, we may share your information with the acquiring entity, but only subject to confidentiality agreements.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">5. Your Rights&nbsp;</p><ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; list-style: disc; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-inline: 0.5em 0px;\"><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Access and Correction: You have the right to access and correct your PII that we hold about you. You can do so by contacting us at&nbsp;<a data-auto-recognition=\"true\" href=\"mailto:champathaisushi@gmail.com\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;\">champathaisushi@gmail.com</a>.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Opt-Out: You can opt-out of receiving marketing communications from us by following the instructions in the email or by contacting us.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Data Portability: You have the right to request a copy of your PII in a machine-readable format.</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Deletion: You can request that we delete your PII, subject to legal obligations and lawful basis.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__tex