-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">We implement reasonable security measures to protect your PII from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">7. Cookies&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">We use cookies and similar technologies to collect Non-PII and improve your website experience. You can manage your cookie preferences through your browser settings.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">8. Children''s Privacy&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Our website is not intended for use by children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect PII from children.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">9. Changes to this Privacy Policy&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post any changes on our website and notify you if the changes are material.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">10. Contact Us&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at&nbsp;<a data-auto-recognition=\"true\" href=\"mailto:champathaisushi@gmail.com\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;\">champathaisushi@gmail.com</a>.</p></div></div></div><!--EndFragment-->\n\n","vertical_align":"center","text_decoration":"none","background_color":"#0a0a0a"}],"height":"large","height_px":900,"auto_height":true},"layouts":[{"id":"layout-1785282971416-srri8h","cells":[{"id":"cell-1785282971416-u90ls9","span":4,"text":"\nPRIVACY POLICY\n1. This Privacy Policy explains how Champa Thai & Sushi, located at 8521 Brier Creek Parkway, Suite 119, Raleigh, NC 27617, collects, uses, and shares information collected through our website, www.champathaisushi.com. By using our website, you consent to the practices described in this policy.  2. Information We Collect Personally Identifiable Information (PII): We may collect PII, such as your name, email address, phone number, and address, when you voluntarily provide it to us through forms on our website, such as when you make a reservation, sign up for our newsletter, or contact us. Non-Personally Identifiable Information (Non-PII): We may automatically collect Non-PII, such as your IP address, browser type, device information, and usage data, through cookies and similar technologies. 3. How We Use Your Information To Provide Services: We use your PII to fulfill your requests, such as processing reservations, responding to inquiries, and providing you with the services you have requested. For Marketing Purposes: We may use your email address to send you promotional materials, newsletters, and special offers, but you can opt-out of these communications at any time. To Improve Our Website: We use Non-PII to analyze website traffic, identify areas for improvement, and personalize your experience. For Legal Compliance: We may use your information to comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements. 4. Sharing Your Information Third-Party Service Providers: We may share your PII with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our website, conducting our business, or servicing you, but only to the extent necessary and subject to confidentiality agreements. Legal Requirements: We may disclose your information if required by law, court order, or to protect our rights, property, or safety, or the rights, property, or safety of others. Business Transfers: In the event of a business transfer, such as a merger or sale, we may share your information with the acquiring entity, but only subject to confidentiality agreements. 5. Your Rights Access and Correction: You have the right to access and correct your PII that we hold about you. You can do so by contacting us at champathaisushi@gmail.com. Opt-Out: You can opt-out of receiving marketing communications from us by following the instructions in the email or by contacting us. Data Portability: You have the right to request a copy of your PII in a machine-readable format.Deletion: You can request that we delete your PII, subject to legal obligations and lawful basis. 6. Security  We implement reasonable security measures to protect your PII from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure.  7. Cookies  We use cookies and similar technologies to collect Non-PII and improve your website experience. You can manage your cookie preferences through your browser settings.  8. Children''s Privacy  Our website is not intended for use by children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect PII from children.  9. Changes to this Privacy Policy  We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post any changes on our website and notify you if the changes are material.  10. Contact Us  If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at champathaisushi@gmail.com.","type":"text","color":"#ffffff","font_size":16,"font_style":"normal","text_align":"center","font_family":"sans","font_weight":"normal","width_percent":100,"rich_text_html":"\n<span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">PRIVACY POLICY</span>\n<!--StartFragment--><div data-hook=\"bgLayers\" data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-m8sxp316\" class=\"QG9w8P\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; mask-image: none; mask-position: 0px 50%; mask-size: 100%; mask-repeat: no-repeat; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10px; text-align: start;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"><div data-motion-part=\"BG_MEDIA comp-m8sxp316\" class=\"ROWgFb\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px;\"></div></div><div data-mesh-id=\"comp-m8sxp316inlineContent\" data-testid=\"inline-content\" class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10px; text-align: start;\"><div data-mesh-id=\"comp-m8sxp316inlineContent-gridContainer\" data-testid=\"mesh-container-content\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial