h-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Non-Personally Identifiable Information (Non-PII): We may automatically collect Non-PII, such as your IP address, browser type, device information, and usage data, through cookies and similar technologies.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">3. How We Use Your Information&nbsp;</p><ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; list-style: disc; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-inline: 0.5em 0px;\"><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">To Provide Services: We use your PII to fulfill your requests, such as processing reservations, responding to inquiries, and providing you with the services you have requested.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">For Marketing Purposes: We may use your email address to send you promotional materials, newsletters, and special offers, but you can opt-out of these communications at any time.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: 