ation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Third-Party Service Providers: We may share your PII with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our website, conducting our business, or servicing you, but only to the extent necessary and subject to confidentiality agreements.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin-inline: 1.3em 0px;\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; outline: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31.5px; font-family: avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0em; margin-block: 0px;\">Legal Requirements: We may disclose your information if required by law, court order, or to protect our rights, property, or safety, or the rights, property, or safety of others.&nbsp;</p></li><li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: initial; border-style: none; o