ttom_px":30}],"page_type":"home-section","collapsible":false,"layer_width":"full","scroll_on_open":false,"background_type":"color","background_color":"#ffffff","initially_hidden":false,"close_button_enabled":false},"settings":{"height":"medium","overlay":false,"text_align":"left","layer_width":"full","overlay_opacity":0},"created_at":"2026-10-30T21:20:24.986671+00:00","is_visible":true,"sort_order":5,"updated_at":"2026-10-30T21:23:02.944036+00:00","business_id":90,"section_type":"custom"},{"id":331,"title":"About","content":{"grid":{"id":"layout-1785369119389-r5m932","cells":[{"id":"cell-1785369119389-usjvk6","span":4,"text":"About Us\nAt Buns, you’re in charge of your burger. Choose one of our three burgers—Angus chuck beef,  Ground turkey, and homemade veggie—and start building! We offer a wide selection of both traditional and unique cheeses and toppings so you can create a simple, classic burger or one with a gourmet flare. If you’re hankering for a sandwich, we’ve got grilled salmon and grilled chicken for you, as well as footlong hot dogs. And if you want to skip the bun altogether, you can top off your Caesar salad with any of the burger patty or sandwich options. Of course, no meal would be complete without a pile of handcut fries on the side and one of our delicious hand-spun milkshakes.\n\nBuns is Chapel Hill’s very own, locally owned and operated burger joint. Our patties are handcrafted daily, and our fries are cut fresh throughout the day using only the finest Idaho potatoes. Our white, wheat and brioche buns are delivered to us freshly baked every day.\n\nCome dine in or carry out at our Columbia Street location in downtown Chapel Hill. Buns is also available for catering events, with a range of options to fit your needs.","type":"text","color":"#ffffff","font_size":16,"font_style":"normal","text_align":"left","font_family":"sans","font_weight":"semibold","line_height":1.6,"width_percent":100,"rich_text_html":"<span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">About Us</span><div>\n<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">At Buns, you’re in charge of your burger. Choose one of our three burgers—Angus chuck beef,  Ground turkey, and homemade veggie—and start building! We offer a wide selection of both traditional and unique cheeses and toppings so you can create a simple, classic burger or one with a gourmet flare. If you’re hankering for a sandwich, we’ve got grilled salmon and grilled chicken for you, as well as footlong hot dogs. And if you want to skip the bun altogether, you can top off your Caesar salad with any of the burger patty or sandwich options. Of course, no meal would be complete without a pile of handcut fries on the side and one of our delicious hand-spun milkshakes.\n\nBuns is Chapel Hill’s very own, locally owned and operated burger joint. Our patties are handcrafted daily, and our fries are cut fresh throughout the day using only the finest Idaho potatoes. Our white, wheat and brioche buns are delivered to us freshly baked every day.\n\nCome dine in or carry out at our Columbia Street location in downtown Chapel Hill. Buns is also available for catering events, with a range of options to fit your needs.</span></div>","vertical_align":"top","text_decoration":"none","background_color":"#2e2e2e"}],"height":"medium","height_px":483,"auto_height":false,"margin_bottom_px":70,"mobile_height_px":824,"layout_width_mode":"full","layout_border_color":"#111827","layout_border_style":"solid","layout_border_width":0,"layout_border_radius":0,"layout_border_enabled":true,"mobile_margin_bottom_px":30},"layouts":[{"id":"layout-1785369119389-r5m932","cells":[{"id":"cell-1785369119389-usjvk6","span":4,"text":"About Us\nAt Buns, you’re in charge of your burger. Choose one of our three burgers—Angus chuck beef,  Ground turkey, and homemade veggie—and start building! We offer a wide selection of both traditional and unique cheeses and toppings so you can create a simple, classic burger or one with a gourmet flare. If you’re hankering for a sandwich, we’ve got grilled salmon and grilled chicken for you, as well as footlong hot dogs. And if you want to skip the bun altogether, you can top off your Caesar salad with any of the burger patty or sandwich options. Of course, no meal would be complete without a pile of handcut fries on the side and one of our delicious hand-spun milkshakes.\n\nBuns is Chapel Hill’s very own, locally owned and operated burger joint. Our patties are handcrafted daily, and our fries are cut fresh throughout the day using only the finest Idaho potatoes. Our white, wheat and brioche buns are delivered to us freshly baked every day.\n\nCome dine in or carry out at our Columbia Street location in downtown Chapel Hill. Buns is also available for catering events, with a range of options to fit your needs.","type":"text","color":"#ffffff","font_size":16,"font_style":"normal","text_align":"left","font_family":"sans","font_weight":"semibold","line_height":1.6,"width_percent":100,"rich_text_html":"<span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">About Us</span><div>\n<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">At Buns, you’re in charge of your burger. Choose one of our three burgers—Angus chuck beef,  Ground turkey, and homemade veggie—and start building! We offer a wide selection of both traditional and unique cheeses and toppings so you can create a simple, classic burger or one with a gourmet flare. If you’re hankering for a sandwich, we’ve got grilled salmon and grilled chicken for you, as well as footlong hot dogs. And if you want to skip the bun altogether, you can top off your Caesar salad with any of the burger patty or sandwich options. Of course, no meal would be complete without a pile of handcut fries on the side and one of our delicious hand-spun milkshakes.\n\nBuns is Chapel Hill’s very own, locally owned and operated burger joint. Our patties are handcrafted daily, and our fries are cut fresh throughout the day using only the finest Idaho potatoes. Our white, wheat and brioche buns are delivered to us freshly baked every day.\n\nCome dine in or carry out at our Columbia Street location in downtown Chapel Hill. Buns is also available for catering events, with a range of options to fit your needs.</span></div>","vertical_align":"top","text_decoration":"none","background_color":"#2e2e2e"}],"height":"medium","height_px":483,"auto_height":false,"margin_bottom_px":70,"mobile_height_px":824,"layout_width_mode":"full","layout_border_color":"#111827","layout_border_style":"solid","layout_border_width":0,"layout_border_radius":0,"layout_border_enabled":true,"mobile_margin_bottom_px":30}],"page_type":"home-section","collapsible":true,"layer_width":"full","scroll_on_open":false,"accordion_label":"About Us","background_type":"color","background_color":"#ffffff","initially_hidden":true,"accordion_font_size":17,"accordion_text_color":"#fafafa","close_button_enabled":false,"accordion_background_color":"#050505"},"settings":{"height":"medium","overlay":false,"text_align":"left","layer_width":"full","overlay_opacity":0},"created_at":"2026-10-30T21:20:24.986671+00:00","is_visible":true,"sort_order":6,"updated_at":"2026-10-30T21:23:03.281308+00:00","business_id":90,"section_type":"about"},{"id":332,"title":"PRIVACY","content":{"grid":{"id":"layout-1785371142780-68wr41","cells":[{"id":"cell-1785371142780-02rdpx","span":4,"text":"Privacy Policy\nBunsOfChapelHill.com is the website of Buns restaurant. The primary purpose of our website is providing information regarding our company, not to gather personal information. We do, however, gather some information that is described below. We currently collect a limited amount of general information from you and only the minimum amount of information necessary to maximize our information services to our website users.\n\nWe will not provide any of your personal information collected by our website to any outside person or company unless we receive your prior express consent. We are committed to maintaining the highest level of privacy practical. The following information describes the information we collect, our privacy policy and the steps we take to protect your personal information. If you have any question about our privacy policy, please contact us.\nInformation Gathered\nYour computer communicates with our website using a particular Internet Protocol Address (IP). Like most sites, we can track the user’s IP when visiting the site. The IP allows us to track for each user the IP, the browser type, the part of the world from which the user is connecting and the identity of the user’s Internet service provider. However, the IP does not provide any personally identifiable information and allows the user to remain anonymous. This information helps us to improve site navigation and to make improvements to the site and content.\n\nPlease be aware that if you voluntarily disclose information over the Internet, personal or otherwise, the information is subject to review and collection by unintended third parties. For example, if you email us, it might be possible for other unintended readers to read the contents of your email. We have no means to control this.\n\nHow We Use Collected Information\nWe record IP addresses for systems administration purposes to obtain data for technical analysis to improve the performance of the website.All communications from you to the website are indexed for technical reasons. For example, it you summit a helpful comment, we keep a record of the information for use by our developers and managers to improve the site. A copy of most messages sent by email is forwarded to our confidential archives, where developers and managers can use the information to make system improvements on a confidential basis and solely for internal purposes and to monitor traffic flow and user satisfaction.When we collect personal information on the order forms, the information is used solely to facilitate the purchase transaction. We follow strict procedures to exchange the necessary payment information with the appropriate financial organizations.\n\nOur Cookies\nYour browser offers so-called “cookies” which — if you allow their use — store small amounts of data on your computer about your visit to our website. Cookies assist us in tracking which of the website features you like best. However, cookies do not disclose any personal information.\n\nThird Party Cookies\nThird party sites hyperlinked from the Center may contain cookies that are collected by the third party site owner. These cookies are beyond our control and we do not have access to this information. However, these cookies do not provide personal information about you.\n\nHyperlinks to Third Party Sites\nOur website contains a number of hyperlinks to the sites of third parties. These hyperlinks are provided as a service to our customers for informational purposes only. However, the privacy policies of these third party sites such as the types of information collected and the use of the collected information is unknown to and beyond our control.\n\nChanges and Modifications\nIn order to improve the level of customer service and to enhance the site over time, we reserve the right to change and modify the Privacy Policy at anytime in the future by posting a revised policy on our website. Furthermore, nothing in this Privacy Policy is designed to protect the privacy of visitors whose use of the website is, in the reasonable judgment of Buns, intended for illegal, improper or abusive purposes or for purposes of marketing or solicitation, or would violate any other terms and conditions relating to use of the website.\n\nIf you have any questions, feel free to contact us.","type":"title","color":"#f9fafb","font_size":25,"font_style":"normal","text_align":"center","font_family":"serif","font_weight":"normal","line_height":1.6,"width_percent":100,"rich_text_html":"<span style=\"font-size: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 42px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">Privacy Policy</span></span></span></span><div>\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">BunsOfChapelHill.com is the website of Buns restaurant. The primary purpose of our website is providing information regarding our company, not to gather personal information. We do, however, gather some information that is described below. We currently collect a limited amount of general information from you and only the minimum amount of information necessary to maximize our information services to our website users.\n\nWe will not provide any of your personal information collected by our website to any outside person or company unless we receive your prior express consent. We are committed to maintaining the highest level of privacy practical. The following information describes the information we collect, our privacy policy and the steps we take to protect your personal information. If you have any question about our privacy policy, please contact us.</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><br></span></div><div>Information Gathered</div><div>\nYour computer communicates with our website using a particular Internet Protocol Address (IP). Like most sites, we can track the user’s IP when visiting the site. The IP allows us to track for each user the IP, the browser type, the part of the world from which the user is connecting and the identity of the user’s Internet service provider. However, the IP does not provide any personally identifiable information and allows the user to remain anonymous. This information helps us to improve site navigation and to make improvements to the site and content.\n\nPlease be aware that if you voluntarily disclose information over the Internet, personal or otherwise, the information is subject to review and collection by unintended third parties. For example, if you email us, it might be possible for other unintended readers to read the contents of your email. We have no means to control this.\n<br></div><div>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">How We Use Collected Information</span></span></div><div>\nWe record IP addresses for systems administration purposes to obtain data for technical analysis to improve the performance of the website.All communications from you to the website are indexed for technical reasons. For example, it you summit a helpful comment, we keep a record of the information for use by our developers and managers to improve the site. A copy of most messages sent by email is forwarded to our confidential archives, where developers and managers can use the information to make system improvements on a confidential basis and solely for internal purposes and to monitor traffic flow and user satisfaction.When we collect personal information on the order forms, the information is used solely to facilitate the purchase transaction. We follow strict procedures to exchange the necessary payment information with the appropriate financial organizations.\n<br></div><div>\n<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">Our Cookies</span></span></div><div>\nYour browser offers so-called “cookies” which — if you allow their use — store small amounts of data on your computer about your visit to our website. Cookies assist us in tracking which of the website features you like best. However, cookies do not disclose any personal information.\n<br></div><div>\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">Third Party Cookies</span></span></div><div>\nThird party sites hyperlinked from the Center may contain cookies that are collected by the third party site owner. These cookies are beyond our control and we do not have access to this information. However, these cookies do not provide personal information about you.\n<br></div><div>\nHyperlinks to Third Party Sites</div><div>\nOur website contains a number of hyperlinks to the sites of third parties. These hyperlinks are provided as a service to our customers for informational purposes only. However, the privacy policies of these third party sites such as the types of information collected and the use of the collected information is unknown to and beyond our control.\n<br></div><div>\nChanges and Modifications</div><div>\nIn order to improve the level of customer service and to enhance the site over time, we reserve the right to change and modify the Privacy Policy at anytime in the future by posting a revised policy on our website. Furthermore, nothing in this Privacy Policy is designed to protect the privacy of visitors whose use of the website is, in the reasonable judgment of Buns, intended for illegal, improper or abusive purposes or for purposes of marketing or solicitation, or would violate any other terms and conditions relating to use of the website.</div><div>\n\nIf you have any questions, feel free to contact us.</div></span></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div>","vertical_align":"center","text_decoration":"none","background_color":"#2e2e2e"}],"height":"large","height_px":1014,"auto_height":true,"margin_bottom_px":0,"mobile_height_px":3000,"layout_width_mode":"full","center_offset_y_px":0,"layout_border_color":"#111827","layout_border_style":"solid","layout_border_width":1,"layout_border_radius":0,"layout_border_enabled":false},"layouts":[{"id":"layout-1785371142780-68wr41","cells":[{"id":"cell-1785371142780-02rdpx","span":4,"text":"Privacy Policy\nBunsOfChapelHill.com is the website of Buns restaurant. The primary purpose of our website is providing information regarding our company, not to gather personal information. We do, however, gather some information that is described below. We currently collect a limited amount of general information from you and only the minimum amount of information necessary to maximize our information services to our website users.\n\nWe will not provide any of your personal information collected by our website to any outside person or company unless we receive your prior express consent. We are committed to maintaining the highest level of privacy practical. The following information describes the information we collect, our privacy policy and the steps we take to protect your personal information. If you have any question about our privacy policy, please contact us.\nInformation Gathered\nYour computer communicates with our website using a particular Internet Protocol Address (IP). Like most sites, we can track the user’s IP when visiting the site. The IP allows us to track for each user the IP, the browser type, the part of the world from which the user is connecting and the identity of the user’s Internet service provider. However, the IP does not provide any personally identifiable information and allows the user to remain anonymous. This information helps us to improve site navigation and to make improvements to the site and content.\n\nPlease be aware that if you voluntarily disclose information over the Internet, personal or otherwise, the information is subject to review and collection by unintended third parties. For example, if you email us, it might be possible for other unintended readers to read the contents of your email. We have no means to control this.\n\nHow We Use Collected Information\nWe record IP addresses for systems administration purposes to obtain data for technical analysis to improve the performance of the website.All communications from you to the website are indexed for technical reasons. For example, it you summit a helpful comment, we keep a record of the information for use by our developers and managers to improve the site. A copy of most messages sent by email is forwarded to our confidential archives, where developers and managers can use the information to make system improvements on a confidential 